OL,3,GNEWSAStrike to bring Piccadilly line
OL,4,Aservices to a halt
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Piccadilly line is set to be
OL,7,Fbrought to a standstill for more than a
OL,8,Fday because of strike action by control
OL,9,Fstaff.
OL,11,FMembers of the Transport Salaried
OL,12,FStaffs' Association (TSSA) working in
OL,13,Fservice control will walk out from
OL,14,F12:00 GMT on Friday until 12:00 on
OL,15,FSaturday.
OL,17,FTransport for London (TfL) said there
OL,18,Fwould be no Piccadilly line services
OL,19,Ffrom midday on Friday until Saturday
OL,20,Fevening, with disruption also expected
OL,21,Fon parts of the District line.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
