OL,3,GNEWSAStrike to bring Piccadilly line
OL,4,Aservices to a halt
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe strike is in response to the
OL,7,Fdismissal of a London Underground
OL,8,Femployee after a disciplinary
OL,9,Finvestigation found he was working a
OL,10,Fsecond job while on sick leave. TfL
OL,11,Fsaid this amounted to gross misconduct.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
